riginal":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TskH+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c4a0b7c-f63f-405d-92cb-ad8d4d718977","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"おお。ありがとうございます。どちらのレポも見てみます。","ts":"1636348291.216400","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1636348304.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vo50"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9b42867-4da9-4ebb-9cab-bdfb91bec8d7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ゴリラさんのでは?","ts":"1636348284.216200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jRw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be68ec3c-d2f8-472b-b1fe-e1875f5b9266","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"\u003c@U025UTETFDJ\u003e 確証はありませんが、もしかしたら neovim の extmarks という機能を使っているのかもしれません。\nneovim の extmarks には ephemeral=true を指定すると、一時的なハイライト扱い。となるのですが、これを使われると syntax や highlight とは別の方法でのハイライトとなるので、synID などでは取得できなくなります。後で余裕があったら extmarks を使っているか見てみましょう。","ts":"1636348283.216000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U025UTETFDJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QIIt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b96beca8-f753-4fce-bedf-e8ef762d5ca9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"じゃないか?","ts":"1636348247.215100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FhhP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"602d4e31-796d-45a1-ad03-3eb58b3c55f9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あーthincaさんのやつ","ts":"1636348223.214500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kr12"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6b440f9-d75d-4f3e-aa1f-4a3931b2d743","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"すいません。以前 quickfix や locationlist バッファで \u0026lt;CR\u0026gt; などで当該箇所を開くようなプラグインをここで紹介されていたと思うのですが、わかる方いらっしゃいますでしょうか。","ts":"1636348204.214100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/bSh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07cd04f1-0a21-4d3e-9f44-33c02bef6916","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"matchでその場で当ててるときって、synIDつくっけ...?","ts":"1636347966.213000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mgZO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b518c86-5160-4c16-8d3f-5373ba751941","type":"message","user":"U025UTETFDJ","text":"neovimのdiagnostic apiはvim標準のシンタックスハイライトとは別の仕組みを使ってハイライトを行ってるってことなんですかね……？","ts":"1636347614.212600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nsX3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f8c8056-e102-4378-8031-bad0ba9e4c68","type":"message","user":"U025UTETFDJ","text":"neovim builtin lspによってdiagnostics (エラーとか) が出されて下線が引かれているところのsynIDを調べてみたところ，0になっています．これって，本来はDiagnosticUnderlineErrorとかのsynIDになっていないとおかしいと思ったのですが，理由・仕組みがわかる人はいますか？","ts":"1636347255.211700","edited":{"user":"U025UTETFDJ","ts":"1636347297.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UX=1"}]}]
